{"id": "3147957", "revid": "542997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3147957", "title": "Picodynastornithes", "text": "Picodynastornithes este o clad\u0103 care con\u021bine ordinele Coraciiformes (dumbr\u0103vence \u0219i pesc\u0103ra\u0219i) \u0219i Piciformes (cioc\u0103nitori \u0219i tucani). Aceast\u0103 grupare are, de asemenea, sprijin actual \u0219i istoric din studii moleculare \u0219i morfologice."}
