{"id": "3147963", "revid": "542997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3147963", "title": "Picocoraciae", "text": "Picocoraciae este o clad\u0103 care con\u021bine ordinul Bucerotiformes (cioc\u00e2rlii \u0219i pupeze) \u0219i clada Picodynastornithes (care con\u021bine p\u0103s\u0103ri precum pesc\u0103ra\u0219i, dumbr\u0103vence, cioc\u0103nitoarele \u0219i tucanii) sus\u021binut\u0103 de diverse analize genetice \u0219i studii morfologice. \u00cen timp ce aceste studii au sus\u021binut o grupare sor\u0103 a Coraciiformes \u0219i Piciformes, o supermatrice pe scar\u0103 larg\u0103 \u0219i rar\u0103 a sugerat \u00een schimb o rela\u021bie sor\u0103 alternativ\u0103 \u00eentre Bucerotiformes \u0219i Piciformes."}
