{"id": "3147988", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3147988", "title": "Australaves", "text": "Australaves este o clad\u0103 de p\u0103s\u0103ri, definit\u0103 \u00een 2012, format\u0103 din Eufalconimorphae (paseriforme, papagali \u0219i \u0219oimi), precum \u0219i Cariamiformes. Acestea par a fi grupul sor\u0103 al Afroaves.\nNumele cladei, care \u00eenseamn\u0103 \u201ep\u0103s\u0103ri sudice\u201d, reflect\u0103 originile evolutive ale grupului \u00een emisfera sudic\u0103: paseriforme \u0219i papagali \u00een Australia, \u0219oimi \u00een America de Sud."}
